  "details": "Context: PCVR, virtual desktop, steam, quest pro, latest beta\n\n* I have reset my bindings via steamvr controller bindings\n\nOn current live, and previously for the past 4 years, the lightbeam used for cursoring around the main menu came from the same angle as steamvr ie beam coming from the top of the controller.\n\nIn the beta, the beam is coming at a really bad angle out from the controllers, effectively making selection making on the menus very difficult.\n\nSee attached image.  (if it doesn't load, as it does for me, https://i.imgur.com/WhxWBO9.png  )",
